OL,3,GNEWSAWarning issued after dead eels
OL,4,Afound in brook
OL,5,
OL,6,FA warning has been issued after dead
OL,7,Ffish were found floating in a brook by
OL,8,Fvolunteers responding to concerns about
OL,9,Fthe state of the waterway.
OL,11,FMembers of Friends of Brislington Brook
OL,12,Fsaid they arrived earlier this week to
OL,13,Fdiscover foam on the water and "an
OL,14,Fintense chemical smell".
OL,16,FLeah Arnold, who helped to clear the
OL,17,FBristol site, said she was "really sad"
OL,18,Fto see dead eels in the brook, which
OL,19,Fshe had not known were living there.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
