OL,3,GNEWSAWarning issued after dead eels
OL,4,Afound in brook
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Environment Agency said it was
OL,7,Finvestigating the incident and awaiting
OL,8,Fresults of water sampling tests. It is
OL,9,Funderstood the agency is looking into
OL,10,Fwhether there is a link between the
OL,11,Fincident and a fire which broke out at
OL,12,Fa derelict warehouse nearby on Tuesday.
